      "description": "Imagine instant ‘appiness’! Old Navy’s new & improved app has all the feel-good fashion & fantastic deals you love — at your fingertips and in your pocket. Shopping on the Old Navy app is fast, fun, and free! It’s the easiest way to shop the hottest trends for the fam anytime, anywhere.\n \nThe Old Navy app makes it easier than ever to find what you’re looking for. Explore hot new arrivals and the latest fashion trends to classic staples for the whole fam.\n \nSearching for something specific? Our search & filter tools make it easy to find what you need. You can also scan the barcode on any product in-store to view pics, see reviews, & more on the app.\n \nShop the app with our mobile-friendly checkout process. Add your fave picks to your bag and check out with easy payment options like PayPal and Apple Pay. Buy online or pick up in-store—whatever works for you!\n \nBest part? When you shop with the new Old Navy app, you find more ways to save! Save more money every time you shop with our best deals & discounts, redeem Super Ca$h & Rewards, plus much more with just a tap!\n \nWHY SHOPPERS LOVE THE OLD NAVY APP\n \nCLOTHES SHOPPING FOR EVERYONE\n•\tDiscover timeless styles, year-round favorites, and more for everyone\n•\tShop women’s clothing, accessories, dresses, sweaters, teen, maternity, and so much more\n•\tFind coveted styles in men’s fashion like year-round must-haves and trendy accessories\n•\tShop trendy and cute clothes for the little ones! Find baby clothes and kids’ clothing easily!\n \nSEARCH TRENDS & SAVE\n•\tShop for kids, women, men & more with our easy search tools!\n•\tDiscover deals & discounts for kids, women, men & more!\n•\tUse your Super Ca$h & Rewards in the app!\n•\tEasily scan items from an Old Navy store to view and order from the app\n•\tGet push notifications to stay in the loop about offers and big sales!\n•\tPick up in-store or get fresh finds delivered right to your door\n•\tManage your Gap Inc. Credit Cards (US only), earn points, check your balance, and pay your bill in a snap\n \nDownload the Old Navy app today and discover the easiest way to shop for styles everyone will love!\n\nStay tuned for new features on the way!",
